+# miXSR_hexer — DEFUNCT
+
+**Status: Defunct.** Retired on November 10, 2026, by project-owner direction.
+**Disposition: failed research candidate.** Retained for historical inspection
+and auditing, with no ongoing maintenance or recommendation for new installs.
+
+Many paths are approximations of the techniques suggested by their labels.
+The owner reports that research ideas, partial implementations and capability
+wording carried across AI workspaces and shader generations. Repeated labels and related code are not
+proof that the named algorithms were implemented or validated. The
+[research and approximation log](RESEARCH_PROVENANCE_LOG.md) distinguishes
+owner-reported provenance problems from scoped source-inspection findings.
+
+## Continue in the current repositories
+
+| Repository | Where to continue |
+|---|---|
+| [Lunar Flower / Twin Lanterns](https://github.com/alia-june/Lunar-Flower) | Twin Lanterns / Crystal Spider development, bounded indirect light, current Fog Guard V2 delivery and documented evidence |
+| [Lazara ReShade Revival Package](https://github.com/dastardlyrat/Lazara-Reshade-Revival-Package) | Curated preset integration and ordered color/luma/detail workflow; Fog Guard V2 is currently delivered through Lunar Flower |
+| [Occult Box](https://github.com/dastardlyrat/Occult-Box) | Individual effects and primitive/helper collection; consult effect-specific status and validation |
+| [OpenSurface Camera Obscura Guided Detail](https://github.com/dastardlyrat/OpenSurface-CameraObscura-GuidedDetail) | Surface-aware detail reclamation and ink-line work |
 
